---

= Instructions

Run a @Lime wedge{} around the rim of a #Cocktail glass{}.
Dip into the @Lime sugar{}, shaking off excess. Fill with @Ice{}.

In a #Cocktail shaker{}, muddle the @Lime juice{1/2 oz}, @Mint leaves{4-6}, @Agave{1-2 tablespoons} to taste, 
and @Pineapple juice{2 oz} or @Pineapple chunks{1/2 cup} – if using chunks, muddle until juicy and crushed.

Add the @Tequila{1 oz}, @Mezcal{1/2 oz}, and @Cointreau{1/2 oz}. Fill the shaker with @Ice{} and shake until cold. 
Strain into the prepared cocktail glass and garnish with a @Pineapple wedge{} and @Mint leaves{}, as desired.

> Lime sugar:\
On a shallow plate, toss together 3 tablespoons of sugar with 1 tablespoon lime zest.